        "title": "Annika has wet hair",
        "text": "Her hair is wet with water but it's not salt water so it must be rain.\nEven from nearby, it carries a faint mineral smell: iron and wet concrete."
      },
      {
        "id": "b679fc90-4391-478e-a9b2-26d77d559301",
        "title": "The chamber was dry and locked",
        "text": "The chamber where Annika was found was dry even though she was wet. And the chamber doors were locked. The police woman acts strange when I ask about the key."
      },
      {
        "id": "d76df082-53b9-41ea-822a-1db50494fac5",
